# Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved

# Xcode user state
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/*.xcuserdatad/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Test artifacts
*.xcresult

# Claude Code worktrees + config
.claude/

# Manuscripts, literature and internal progress reports.
#
# This repository is public. Unpublished drafts and third-party documents
# do not belong in it — the literature review in particular is someone
# else's to distribute. Kept on disk, out of git.
paper/
*.docx
*.pdf
phase*_report.md
docs/AUDIT_PHASE_*.md

# Field data and its analysis.
#
# 390 MB of raw depth captures from McDunn, plus unpublished accuracy
# results that belong in the manuscript before they belong in public.
val/
# ...but the ANALYSIS CODE is not data. A reviewer objected, correctly, that a
# resolution rule asserted to have been "fixed before looking at what it would
# do to the result" is unverifiable when its file has no history — and that
# rule turned out to be the most serious defect in the study. The scripts are
# what settles that, so they are tracked.
#
# THE DERIVED TABLES ARE NOT. This repository is public and the study is not
# published, so the 100-stem table and the results CSVs stay out; they settle
# nothing about provenance and publishing them is not reversible.
!val/analysis/
!val/analysis/**/*.py
!val/analysis/**/*.md
!val/paper/
!val/paper/*.py
val/analysis/*.csv
val/paper/results/
